nd while he Samia is  talking his greatest support and best  friend he's also talking his greatest  rival however Yuki you know sama stands  as a close second pushing talk to me to  the very limits of his own Italian  cooking style the heart of which is his  unique cooking tool the Mezzaluna the  Mezzaluna is a crescent-shaped knife  with double handles a tool which  requires an extreme amount of skill  precision and control operate Takumi is  able to use this knife with incredible  fan  speed and he even invented a special  move called la danza de la spada  that only he can perform using the knife  he starts spinning the Mezzaluna like a  baton speeding it up to an incredibly  high speed with each flick of his  fingers he then uses the Mezzaluna to  chop his ingredients precisely in almost  instantaneously la danza de la spada is  described as a sword danced alchemy  performs before the cutting board the  Mezzaluna however is not just a simple  tool it represents the connection  between him and his brother Issa me the  twin brothers are the strongest tag-team  at kutsuki Academy and became known as  totes keys unbeatable twins they  understand each other's strengths and  weaknesses well enough to bring out the  best in each other's cooking as the best  italian chef in his year currently  enrolled in Totsuka academy many of  talking these dishes stem from italian  cuisine but he often adds a twist  showing that he is not only a master in  one form of cuisine but is also  incredibly skilled in mixing different  cooking styles the dish talk to me is  most remembered for is a classic Italian  insalata frittata which he made during  the breakfast buffet challenge during  the totes key friendship and rapport  training camp the frittata he made with  eggs and cheese is meant to be broken  into little pieces and eaten with a  solid combining the rough chunks of  frittata with vegetables like tomatoes  cucumbers and lettuce all of this is  finished off with Parmesan cheese 