on names in the tuscany region of  Florence in Italy aldini means wise and  experience quite fitting for him after  everything he's learned through his  education at Totsuka speaking of which  Takamine actually has a fan club at the  academy which was formed only one month  after he entered the middle school  section Takumi and ISA me each carry a  bottle of aldini olive oil at all times  and thanks to mimasaka Subarus very  thorough investigations we actually have  a lot of truly useless facts about  Takumi aldini Takumi is said to be  afraid of heights to call his home twice  a month set two alarms before going to  sleep and to prefer showers to baths he  also wears checkered pattern underwear  thanks Subaru for all of this truly  useless insight about talk to me but  that pretty much does it for all Dini  talk to me if you enjoyed this video and  the content this channel produces in  general then please do consider donating  to the new world revue patreon as the  support of all you amazing people is  what continues to make this channel  possible and if patreon isn't quite your  style and please do leave this video a  like share or subscribe as it also helps  to support us in  and if you'd like to join in on the fun  at any time then please do head over to  our discord server where a wide array of  shenanigan ray takes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment on  who what or where you'd like to see  featured on the next show kageki 101  [Music]

